       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. GROUP-ITEMS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 EMPLOYEE-DETAILS.
          05 EMPLOYEE-ID PIC 9(5) VALUE 10234.
          05 EMPLOYEE-NAME.
             10 FIRST-NAME PIC X(10) VALUE "ARJUN".
             10 LAST-NAME PIC X(10) VALUE "KUMAR".
          05 EMPLOYEE-SALARY PIC 9(6)V99 VALUE 45000.50.
       01 EMPLOYEE-BACKUP PIC X(33).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "EMPLOYEE ID: " EMPLOYEE-ID.
           DISPLAY "FIRST NAME: " FIRST-NAME.
           DISPLAY "LAST NAME: " LAST-NAME.
           DISPLAY "EMPLOYEE NAME: " EMPLOYEE-NAME.
           DISPLAY "SALARY: " EMPLOYEE-SALARY.
           MOVE EMPLOYEE-DETAILS TO EMPLOYEE-BACKUP.
           DISPLAY "COMPLETE RECORD: " EMPLOYEE-BACKUP.
           STOP RUN.
